cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use steercert, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "steercert: sensor/actuator audits for language-model probes and steering vectors"
abstract: >-
  steercert measures whether the direction a linear probe reads in a language
  model's activations also controls the behaviour it detects, using per-example
  behavioural gradients and the effect Gramian, with reporting rules,
  construction-matched controls, held-out validation and integrations with
  steering and interpretability libraries.
type: software
authors:
